this header here creates noise, and makes it harder for the agent / plugin to parse the policy data:
```
policy_data:
  compliance_framework:
    approved_ssl_policies: []
```
As opposed to:
```
policy_data
  approved_ssl_policies: []
```

The second option is better. Please format policies, this file, and test to use the behavior which is better for users.

I am aware this might be a design decision - we should review the design.
